<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-epitaph-liumeizi-stone" book-id="b-epitaph-liumeizi-stone-full" chapter-id="c-epitaph-liumeizi-stone-full" source-id="s-epitaph-liumeizi-stone-xiangshan-m9">
  <p id="c-epitaph-liumeizi-stone-full:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">晉振威將軍鄱陽太守都亭侯琅耶臨沂縣都鄉南仁里<persName id="c-epitaph-liumeizi-stone-full:p001:m0022" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBAA">王建之</persName>字<persName id="c-epitaph-liumeizi-stone-full:p001:m0026" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBAA">榮妣</persName>故夫人南陽湦陽<persName id="c-epitaph-liumeizi-stone-full:p001:m0035" ref="mfd_id2_bu3_AA">劉氏</persName>字<persName id="c-epitaph-liumeizi-stone-full:p001:m0038" ref="mfd_id2_bu3_AA">媚子</persName>春秋五十三泰和六年六月戊戌朔十四日辛亥薨于郡官舍夫人脩武令<persName id="c-epitaph-liumeizi-stone-full:p001:m0069" ref="mfd_id2_bu3">乂</persName>之孫光祿勳東昌男<persName id="c-epitaph-liumeizi-stone-full:p001:m0078" ref="mfd_id2_bu3_A">璞</persName>之長女年廿來歸生三男三女二男未識不育大女<persName id="c-epitaph-liumeizi-stone-full:p001:m0099" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBAAA">玉龜</persName>次女<persName id="c-epitaph-liumeizi-stone-full:p001:m0103" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBAAB">道末</persName>並二歲亡小女<persName id="c-epitaph-liumeizi-stone-full:p001:m0111" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBAAC">張願</persName>適濟陰<persName id="c-epitaph-liumeizi-stone-full:p001:m0116" ref="6w0_y3q_k7s">卞嗣之</persName>字<persName id="c-epitaph-liumeizi-stone-full:p001:m0120" ref="6w0_y3q_k7s">奉伯</persName>小男<persName id="c-epitaph-liumeizi-stone-full:p001:m0124" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBAAD">紀之</persName>字<persName id="c-epitaph-liumeizi-stone-full:p001:m0127" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBAAD">元萬</persName>其年十月丙申朔三日戊戌喪還都十一月乙未朔八日壬寅倍葬于舊墓在丹楊建康之白石故刻石為識</p>
</text>
